{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の東京は澄み切った青空がとても綺麗でしたが、身体の芯から冷え込む感じでした＞_＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大寒波の影響で、とても寒い日々が続いていますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん、くれぐれも体調管理お気をつけて下さいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなはいつも首とつく部位(首元、手首、足首)が冷えないように気をつけています。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る時は腹巻も...。お腹も冷えないようにしているよ(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はお仕事から帰る時、寒すぎて寒すきて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家まで全力疾走で帰ったよ...＞_＜笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家に着いた時はポカポカしていました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日々、身体をあたためることを考えて過ごしています。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2016/01/26/6443243/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、大好きな市川拓司さんから、サイン本を頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2016/01/26/6443243/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つ上のお姉ちゃんに薦められて読んだ「こんなにも優しい、世界の終わりかた」。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この本をきっかけに、私も市川拓司さんが描く世界観に魅了されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"市川さんの本で溢れている、お姉ちゃんのお部屋に行くと、どの物語を読もうかな...とすごくワクワクします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉ちゃんの後を追うように、私も市川拓司さんの作品を一つ一つ読ませて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなが、これから活動していく中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この市川さんからの「宝物」は私にとって大きな大きなエネルギーになります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大切にします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみりーさんにお知らせです*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊2月5日発売の雑誌「ダ・ヴィンチ」3月号。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月佑美ちゃん、井上小百合ちゃん、日奈の3人で''2.5次元女子座談会''というものをさせて頂きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山お話しているので、ぜひ読んでほしいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊2月22日(月)19:50～20:10"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NHKラジオ第2放送「高校講座 現代社会」さんにゲストとして呼んで頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＊2月23日発売の雜誌「UTB vol.240」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのソログラビア。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごくすっごく..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったです(/ _ ; )♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2016/01/26/6443243/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影が楽しみで、前日の夜は眠れなかったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、当日の朝は4時半に目が覚めてしまって...まだ家族が寝ている中、1人お布団の上でワクワク、ソワソワしていました( ´ ▽ ` )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ、色んな表情の日奈をみなさんにみて頂きたいです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「昭和ろまん」な感じに撮って頂きました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2016/01/26/6443243/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショット♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆1月21日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【リンクスさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【さいたまのまゆさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ベッツさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ちゃーりーさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【りゅーごさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【いよかん♀さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【カンパネラさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【サムデイさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【としさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ベルくろす(*´ω｀*)さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【みいたんたん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆1月22日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【いなかもんじろうさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ショーグンさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ももちゃむさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【りょうた！グラステ♩さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ホビットさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【福岡のしょーちゃん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ゆうちゃん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ゆうかひなさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【てつやさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【ボブちゃん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【つぶらやぱんださん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆【生ちゃん】☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆【まいちゅん】☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragra